                    "Singrauli coalfield spans Sonbhadra district of Uttar Pradesh and Singrauli district of MP, supplying coal to mega thermal power plants of NTPC.",
                    "Talcher in the Mahanadi valley (Odisha) and Singareni in the Godavari valley (Telangana) are major non-coking coalfields.",
                    "Neyveli in Cuddalore district of Tamil Nadu possesses the largest deposits of Lignite [लिग्नाइट] (brown coal) in India, operated by NLC India Ltd."
